  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Removing Dis from Ability of 30 youths!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is designed to build the income-generating knowledge and skills in beekeeping for 30 young men and women with disabilities in Berd region, one of remote areas in the North-East part of Armenia -Tavush Marz (administrative unit of several regions).  The primary aim of the project is to improve living condition of this marginalized group of men and women with disabilities in rural communities. Youth will practice the basic competencies in Bee Hive Components   and Honey Production.</narrative>
  </description>
